# Example for base topic panel/living-room; use distinct credentials per panel.
# Replace usernames and exact discovery IDs together when changing the panel topic.
user panel-living-room
topic read panel/living-room/set/#
topic read panel/living-room/state/#
topic read panel/living-room/cmd/#
topic read homeassistant/status
topic write panel/living-room/status
